{"articleNo":"176237","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=176237&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"금오광장 차량통행 금지 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2017.07.26","hit":"2962","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">금오광장 차량 통행 금지 안내</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">금오광장 주변 차량통행으로 인한 포장재 파손이 반복되어 시설물 관리에 어려움이</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;있는 관계로&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;금오광장 포장보수공사 완료 후&nbsp;아래와 같이 <font color=\"#ff007f\"><strong>차량통행을 금지</strong><font color=\"#666666\">하오니</font></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;납품차량 및&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">공사차량을 우회조치토록 협조하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<font color=\"#ff007f\">1. 차량통행 금지 구간 : 금오광장(테크노관 서편 및 도서관 후편 차량통행금지)</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#ff007f\">&nbsp; 2. 통행차량 우회방법 : 테크노관 북측&nbsp;및 도서관 전면&nbsp;이용</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#ff007f\">&nbsp; 3. 통행금지 일시 : 2017. 7.28일 부터 </font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#ff007f\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 시 설 안 전 과</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
